{"tour":{"id":"BLA70Vds","name":"FIDE Candidates 2026: Open","slug":"fide-candidates-2026-open","info":{"format":"8-player double round-robin","tc":"120 min / 40 moves + 30 min, + 30 sec / move from move 41","fideTC":"standard","location":"Pegeia, Cyprus","timeZone":"Asia/Nicosia","players":"Nakamura, Caruana, Wei, Giri, Sindarov, Praggnanandhaa, Esipenko, Bluebaum","website":"https://candidates2026.fide.com/","standings":"https://candidates2026.fide.com/crosstable#open"},"createdAt":1772471609072,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/BLA70Vds","tier":5,"dates":[1774788300000,1776257100000],"image":"https://image.lichess.org/display?fmt=webp&h=400&op=thumbnail&path=-chkVBAKMOUf.webp&w=800&sig=910f1d3299a305ccd800fe62d148b599a8eeec71","description":"The 2026 FIDE Candidates Tournament and the 2026 FIDE Women’s Candidates Tournament form the final qualifying stage of the FIDE World Championship cycle.\r\n\r\nEach tournament features eight of the world’s strongest players competing in a double round-robin format over fourteen rounds of classical chess.\r\n\r\nAt the conclusion of the events, the winners secure the right to challenge for the FIDE World Chess Championship and FIDE Women’s World Chess Championship titles.\r\n\r\nWatch Lichess' interviews at the Candidates on [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe5ZNOR8Ttm2och_ZJuqSQo6TBxFNo5om), and read our game [annotations](https://lichess.org/study/Y1yXP80U) by GM Axel Bachmann, GM Maksim Chigaev, WGM Petra Papp, IM Lilit Mkrtchian, and WGM Ekaterina Atalik.\r\n\r\n## Tiebreaks\r\n- **Stage I**\r\n  - 2 players: 2-game match, 15+10 time control.  \r\n  - 3–6 players: round robin, 15+10.  \r\n  - 7–8 players: round robin, 10+5.  \r\n- **Stage II** (if still tied)  \r\n  - 2 players: 2-game match, 3+2.  \r\n  - More than 2 players: round robin, 3+2.  \r\n- **Stage III** (if still tied)  \r\n  - Knockout, 1 game at 3+2.  \r\n  - If drawn: replay with reversed colors.  \r\n  - If still drawn, sudden death: White 4+2, Black bids time ≤4 minutes. Black wins if game is drawn."},"rounds":[{"id":"uLCZwqAK","name":"Round 1","slug":"round-1","finishedAt":1774808855047,"finished":true,"startsAt":1774788300000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-1/uLCZwqAK"},{"id":"FRTlzP2X","name":"Round 2","slug":"round-2","finishedAt":1774892254111,"finished":true,"startsAt":1774874700000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-2/FRTlzP2X"},{"id":"SDizieNR","name":"Round 3","slug":"round-3","finishedAt":1774975416632,"finished":true,"startsAt":1774961100000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-3/SDizieNR"},{"id":"97di6JjX","name":"Round 4","slug":"round-4","finishedAt":1775066322116,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775047500000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-4/97di6JjX"},{"id":"liBI9Brw","name":"Round 5","slug":"round-5","finishedAt":1775234193107,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775220300000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-5/liBI9Brw"},{"id":"WmbQrSNz","name":"Round 6","slug":"round-6","finishedAt":1775325100788,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775306700000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-6/WmbQrSNz"},{"id":"aVbIuZ7Q","name":"Round 7","slug":"round-7","finishedAt":1775410154830,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775393100000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-7/aVbIuZ7Q"},{"id":"XYRPyV8x","name":"Round 8","slug":"round-8","finishedAt":1775583716064,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775565900000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-8/XYRPyV8x"},{"id":"hTVc2Qgj","name":"Round 9","slug":"round-9","finishedAt":1775673061041,"finished":true,"startsAt":1775652300000,"url":"https://lichess.org/broadcast/fide-candidates-2026-open/round-9/hTVc2Qgj"},{"id":"G3oSxPgs","name":"Round 10","slug":"round-10","finishedAt":1775752377568,"finishe